                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 795B.5–MSP/7–155. Confidential. Drafted by Howard F.
                        Smith of NA, cleared with ICA and the Department of Defense, and approved by
                        McClurkin. Repeated to Tokyo.</p>
